<Slide style={{ background: '#F5F1E6', padding: '40px 64px', fontFamily: '宋体' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', height: 72, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.15 }}>六尺巷</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>原文页</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.1 }}>张家盖房，占了吴家三尺地。两家争执不下，</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.1 }}>张家写信到京城求助。回信只有四句：</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#B4552D', lineHeight: 2.1, marginTop: 16 }}>"千里修书只为墙，让他三尺又何妨。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#B4552D', lineHeight: 2.1 }}>万里长城今犹在，不见当年秦始皇。"</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.1, marginTop: 16 }}>张家让三尺，吴家也让三尺——成了六尺巷。</Text>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, marginTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.2)', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 8, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>《乡土中国》· 第 4 课时</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D' }}>13/19</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>